public of Suriname on the Abolition of Visas for Holders of Ordinary Passports | url=https://tratados.mrecic.gov.ar/tratado_ficha.php?id=10002 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170917171615/http://tratados.mrecic.gov.ar/tratado_ficha.php?id=10002 | archive-date=2017-09-17}}</ref> [[Armenia]] (January 2012),<ref>{{Cite web| title=Acuerdo entre el Gobierno de la República Argentina y el Gobierno de la República de Armenia sobre Supresión de Visados en Pasaportes Comunes | language=es | trans-title=Agreement between the Government of the Argentine Republic and the Government of the Republic of Armenia on the Abolition of Visa Requirements in Common Passports | url=https://tratados.mrecic.gov.ar/tratado_ficha.php?id=10068 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170917170826/http://tratados.mrecic.gov.ar/tratado_ficha.php?id=10068 | archive-date=2017-09-17}}</ref> and [[Ukraine]] (October 2011)<ref>{{Cite web| title=Convenio entre el Gobierno de la República Argentina y el Gobierno de Ucrania sobre Supresión de Visas | language=es | trans-title=Agreement between the Government of the Argentine Republic and the Government of Ukraine on Visa Abolition | url=https://tratados.mrecic.gov.ar/tratado_ficha.php?id=9952 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170917171153/http://tratados.mrecic.gov.ar/tratado_ficha.php?id=9952 | archive-date=2017-09-17}}</ref>

