===History===
Argentine citizens were made eligible for e-Visas recently by [[Guinea]] and [[Malawi]] (October 2019), [[Pakistan]] (April 2019), [[Tanzania]] and [[Papua New Guinea]] (November 2018),<ref name="herald.ng"/> [[Djibouti]] (February 2018),<ref name="Fave"/><ref name="egyptindependent.com"/> [[Azerbaijan]] (January 2017),<ref name="auto4"/> [[India]] (e-Tourist visa from November 2014)<ref name="Paladhi"/> and [[Myanmar]] (September 2014).<ref name="Eleven Myanmar"/>

